---
import { Image, JsonLD, Markdown, Partial, SVG } from '@splendidlabz/astro'
import { FancyList } from '@splendidlabz/astro/svelte'
import { now } from '../content/data/now'
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'

const nowItems = now.slice(0, 3)

const SEOProps = {
  title: 'About',
  openGraph: {
    basic: { type: 'profile' },
    profile: {
      firstName: 'Zell',
      lastName: 'Liew',
      username: 'zellwk',
    },
  },
}

export const prerender = true
---

<Base bodyClass="home-page" {...SEOProps}>
  <JsonLD
    type="ProfilePage"
    mainEntity={{
      type: 'Person',
      name: 'Zell Liew',
      url: 'https://zellwk.com/',
      sameAs: [
        'https://twitter.com/zellwk',
        'https://github.com/zellwk',
        'https://linkedin.com/in/zellwk',
        'https://instagram.com/zellwk',
        'https://bsky.app/profile/zellwk.bsky.social',
        'https://facebook.com/zellwk',
        'https://css-tricks.com/author/zellwk/',
      ],
    }}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div
        class="vertical bp10:grid-auto-fr bp10:max-w-mid mx-auto bp10:gap-[1.5rlh]"
      >
        <div>
          <Image
            class="max-w-[22rem] rounded-1.5r"
            src="/src/assets/zell/zell-fooling-around.jpg"
            alt="Zell"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="bp10:mt-20 vertical">
          <div
            class="june [--font-style:65] text-zgray-500 text-center bp10:text-left -mb-2"
          >
            Last updated on: September 15th, 2026
          </div>
          <hgroup class="vertical hero-heading items-center bp10:items-start">
            <h1 class="h1 text-center bp10:text-left text-zpurple-500">
              Heya, I'm Zell
            </h1>
            <p class="h1-subhead -mt-2">
              Welcome to my corner of the internet. Thanks for stopping by :)
            </p>
          </hgroup>
          <div class="prose text-10">
            <!-- prettier-ignore -->
            <Markdown>
              I'm a web developer. I've spent the last 13 years building sites, writing about code, and teaching developers through courses like Learn JavaScript and Practical Astro.

              These days I build AI and automation systems that make businesses easier to run, alongside Splendid Labz, the tools I build my own projects with.

              **Besides code, I'm deeply interested in psychology + human development.** I've spent over 10 years learning about my psychology and how to develop myself, and since 2023 I've been coaching people to unblock themselves and move towards their dreams.
            </Markdown>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-cont">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div
        class="grid-simple max-bp10:gap-large [--cols:1] bp10:[--cols:7] bp10:max-w-standard mx-auto mt-section"
      >
        <h2 class="h1 text-zorange-500 max-bp10:text-center bp10:[--span:7]">
          My Unusual Journey
        </h2>
        <div class="card card-orange bp10:[--span:4]">
          <div class="prose text-10">
            <Markdown inline>
              <FancyList
                class="ml-0"
                icon="ph:egg-crack"
                iconClass="simple-svg fill-zorange-500"
                items={[
                  `I studied finance in school, but taught myself how to code in the penultimate year.`,
                  `Went freelance fresh out of school within 10 months of learning web dev.`,
                  `Wrote my first book 2 years after I started learning code.`,
                  `Gave conference talks and workshops in the next year.`,
                  `Seth Godin told me "well said" for one of my talks. And that I didn't embarrass myself in front of 400 people.`,
                  `Somehow managed to stay afloat for more than a decade so I never had a traditional job`,
                  `Built in a course-based business that earned close to $100k in annual sales at one point.`,
                  `Over several years, I managed to coach my wife to a point where her ex-boss trusts her enough to cofound a new business venture with her! (She's doing well now!)`,
                ]}
              />
            </Markdown>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bp10:[--span:3] self-end prose mb-16 text-zgray-500">
          <Markdown>
            Unfortunately, sales dwindled because I went dark for a while, so
            I'm no longer one of the top searches on Google. It's difficult to
            get that back, especially in the AI age, so I'm pivoting to
            different business model. Wish me luck!
          </Markdown>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SVG class="w-full" icon="wriggle-line" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap vertical gap-large">
      <h2 class="h1 text-zcyan-500 text-center">What I'm Exploring Now</h2>
      <div class="grid-simple bp10:[--cols:3] max-w-mid mx-auto">
        <div class="prose bp10:[--span:2] text-10">
          <!-- prettier-ignore -->
          <Markdown>
            AI taken over the planet. (Let's face it, it's here). At the very least, it has cannibalized my course business --- anyone can ask AI about code, so few people want to buy another coding course. 

            So I'm back to explore. 

            **Most of that exploration revolves around AI and automation**. 

            - Building systems to make businesses easier to run. 
            - Making personal automation systems like email filtering, triage and drafting of replies 
            - Figuring out how to get AI to write better (ongoing) 
            - Getting AI to write better code and better documentation.

            Alongside that, I'm still:

            1. Creating unique courses that AI cannot replicate (like <strong class="text-zpurple-500">Unorthodox Tailwind</strong>).
            2. Building <strong class="text-zorange-500">Practical Astro</strong>, production-ready Astro patterns you can plonk into real projects.
            3. Building <strong class="text-zcyan-500">Splendid Labz</strong>, the tools I build my projects with. There are component libraries for Astro and Svelte, a CSS design system, and AI libraries.
            4. <strong class="text-zred-500">Coaching people</strong> to help them unblock themselves and unravel their potential in life.

            Ultimately, I'm looking to create sustainable and thriving businesses that works for me. I don't think I'd ever want to stop growing, so I'd probably never stop exploring too. 
          </Markdown>

          <h3 class="h2 text-zcyan-500">Work With Me</h3>

          <Markdown>
            If your team is spending hours on work that probably shouldn't need
            a human, [tell me what you're doing manually](/contact/) and I'll
            help you figure out what's possible.
          </Markdown>
        </div>

        <div class="flow bp10:vertical justify-center">
          {
            nowItems.map(item => (
              <div
                class:list={[
                  'card card-small text-8 vertical',
                  `card-${item.color}`,
                ]}
              >
                <h3 class="h4 card-title">{item.title}</h3>
                <Markdown>{item.content}</Markdown>
                <a
                  href={item.link}
                  class="button button-outline justify-self-start"
                >
                  {item.cta}
                </a>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Partial path="TestimonialSection" />
  <Partial path="FollowMyJourney" />
</Base>
